</table>
<div class="at-glance" style="margin:8px 0 0"><b>(a)</b> {{ dealer_book.words_a }}</div>
<div class="at-glance" style="margin:4px 0 0"><b>(b)</b> {{ dealer_book.words_b }}</div>
<div class="box-note">Black-Scholes greeks (r = 0) from each UW contract's IV, summed over open interest: {{ dealer_book.contracts }} contracts, expiries {{ dealer_book.expiries }}. Which assumption holds is not known; the reports show both.</div>
</div>
