  {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>
<div class="box-note">UW does not document how it computes its gamma flip, and the open-interest and volume flips can differ. The regime follows the open-interest flip; the other rows are cross-checks and do not vote. Put Wall uses the UW 181-365 day band.</div>
</div>
</details>

